description "General Crix Madine

^9Weapons:
- Melee
- Command Baton (Blue Saber)
^2-- Hit: Slow
^2-- Knockback: +.1
^1-- Block: No
^1-- Chain: 2
^1-- Length: 30
- DL-18 Blaster Pistol (3)
^2-- Hit: Stagger
^2-- Damage: 1.35x
^2-- Drain: 1.35x
^1-- RoF: .8x
^1-- Mag reload speed: .76x
- Strike Order (Minigun 3)
^2-- Hitscan: Explode/slow/focus/track
^1-- Damage: .01x
^1-- RoF: .05x
^1-- AoE: 50u
- Frag Grenade (2)
- Pulse-Flare Grenade (2)
^2-- Det: Burn/push

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Gunkick ^3[CS2]
- Quick Throw (1) ^3[CS3]

^5Powers:
- Team Energize (1)

^6Items:
- Forcefield
- Medpac ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Healing (2)
- Getup (2)
- Dexterity (1)
- Rally
- Tracking Beacon
^2- Knockback given: 1.1x

A strong tactician who can paint targets for team-assisted destruction, and hold his own with specialty arms."